# A repo renamed since the last owner listing stored it. The caching proxy in
# front of the host answers its git tree with a redirect instead of a tree, so
# there is no module directory to read and nothing to index. Its work item still
# completes, rather than the queue handing the repo out again every re-indexing
# TTL for as long as the stale name is stored.
repo someorg/renamed
renamed
head 0011223344556677889900112233445566778899 2026-01-02T03:04:05Z
-- someorg/renamed/go.mod --
module go.example.com/renamed
-- want --
